flowchart LR
    API[Transactional API / Domain Service]
    OUTBOX[(SQL Outbox<br/>optional but recommended)]
    PUB[Outbox Publisher]
    TOPIC[Azure Service Bus Topic]
    SUB[Audit subscription]
    FUNC[Azure Function consumer]
    COSMOS[(Azure Cosmos DB<br/>audit metadata)]
    BLOB[(Azure Blob Storage<br/>large payloads)]
    DLQ[Subscription DLQ]
    OPS[Operations / replay job]
    MON[Azure Monitor / Application Insights]

    API -->|business transaction + outbox row| OUTBOX
    OUTBOX --> PUB
    PUB -->|AuditEvent with stable eventId| TOPIC
    TOPIC --> SUB
    SUB --> FUNC
    FUNC -->|small payload or metadata + blob reference| COSMOS
    FUNC -->|large payload, deterministic blob name| BLOB
    SUB -. max delivery count exceeded .-> DLQ
    OPS -->|inspect, repair, controlled replay| DLQ
    OPS -->|resubmit after approval| TOPIC
    MON --- API
    MON --- PUB
    MON --- TOPIC
    MON --- FUNC
    MON --- COSMOS
    MON --- BLOB
